<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week from September 30 to October 4, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners have been net buyers for the past five weeks, according to the data.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   397.85 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  380.77 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  17.07 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week's net buying     6.79 million yen</p>
</text>
